1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,720
You just read a whole page. Be honest —
can you remember one single sentence?

2
00:00:06,167 --> 00:00:10,377
It is not your attention span.
It is the shape of the text.

3
00:00:12,333 --> 00:00:19,253
Sixty words before a single break. Your eyes
have to carry all of it before any of it means anything.

4
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:22,480
So we broke it apart.
Sixty words, down to twenty-eight.

5
00:00:22,933 --> 00:00:29,463
Same words. Every single one. Nothing rewritten,
nothing summarised, nothing deleted.

6
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:35,930
Here's what nobody checks. Tools that simplify
text quietly change what it says.

7
00:00:35,167 --> 00:00:44,157
Antibiotics do not work against viruses becomes
antibiotics work against viruses. Opposite meaning.

8
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:52,230
So this one counts what has to survive.
Every number. Every name. Every not.

9
00:00:52,667 --> 00:00:55,257
Thirteen out of thirteen. Kept.

10
00:00:55,700 --> 00:01:02,390
It's called legible. Free, offline, open source.
Your text never leaves your machine.

